# C2: mlmf-conformance's direct dependencies. Changing this file is a
# deliberate act. Keep sorted.
#
# All three, and that combination is the entire reason this crate exists. It
# is the only place in the workspace where more than one backend is linked
# into one binary, which is what a cross-backend conformance test needs and
# what neither backend may have -- a dependency between two sibling backends
# is not a relationship the seam describes.
#
# A missing file here is a loud panic in deps.rs::allow_list rather than a
# trivially-satisfied empty list, which is why this file is written out
# rather than left absent.
mlmf-core
mlmf-gguf
mlmf-safetensors
